{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_112_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "7df2e0945b7207e99eb2815f8f2ffdf09013b1cf354c68d457dba99f3ba470ad", "ja": "はい。ですが、\n手品では勝負がつかず。\n最後はカードで。", "zh": "是的。不过，\n魔术分不出胜负。\n最后就用纸牌决胜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_112_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_112_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "44e8b87ba2baff88e80f5c0d63bb1795b207eacc3a8530e1b9d8706c654bc47e", "ja": "ポーカーは、\n得意なほうだったのですが。\n……おかしいぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "我本来是比较擅长扑克的。\n……不对劲啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
